      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walhalla%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Walhalla's oldest building, a fur trading post, dates back to 1797 and is preserved by the State Historical Society.",
