      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walhalla%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2023, paleontologists uncovered a mosasaur fossil near Walhalla, naming it Jormungandr walhallaensis after the town.",
